stale family-only\n31\t   record crosses a route boundary; `load_family` enumerates one family's valid\n32\t   records for the dispatcher's keep-warm; `adjudicator_launch` refuses a\n33\t   missing route id. Driven: a stored `OPENAI-A` session is never resumed for\n34\t   `OPENAI-B` (`test_launch_never_resumes_another_route_of_the_same_family`).\n35\t2. MAJOR (governing hash omitted the judging templates) — `map_preflight` now\n36\t   returns the actual file each loaded prompt came from (override-aware);\n37\t   `resolve_session_setup` carries the four `adjudicate-*` paths on\n38\t   `LoopContext.adjudicator_prompt_paths`; `route_session` passes them to\n39\t   `adjudicator_launch`, whose `governing_hash` folds them in; a changed\n40\t   judging instruction drains the session and retires it at the next clear\n41\t   point. Driven at both ends:\n42\t   `test_governing_hash_changes_with_the_loaded_adjudication_template`,\n43\t   `test_preflight_surfaces_the_loaded_adjudication_template_to_the_hash`,\n44\t   `test_loaded_adjudication_prompt_change_retires_at_clear_point`.\n45\t3. MAJOR (OPENAI/OPENCODE never read their telemetry) —\n46\t   `adjudicator_session.context_telemetry` selects the reader by family:\n47\t   OPENAI joins the emitted `thread.started.thread_id` to the exact\n48\t   `rollout-*-<id>.jsonl` under the launch environment's `CODEX_HOME` (no\n49\t   `--last`, no ambient home — either could select another route's\n50\t   transcript); OPENCODE reads its own `--format json` stream.\n51\t   `adjudicator_bookkeeping` persists the captured id, so a later launch\n52\t   resumes instead of minting; `session_meta` merges the retained columns\n53\t   blank-by-blank over WI-535's one-shot tuple. Driven:\n54\t   `test_openai_bookkeeping_captures_thread_and_rollout_then_resumes`,\n55\t   `test_opencode_bookkeeping_captures_stream_session_then_resumes`.\n56\t4. MINOR (IF-174 Rationale cited history) — the cell now states only the\n57\t   standing reason; provenance l